<section>
<h2>Best practice</h2>
<ul>
<li>Caption videos</li>
<li>Provide a text transcript for audio</li>
</ul>
</section>

  <section>
  <h2>Why do you use captions?</h2>
  <p><a target="tweede" href="https://sebastiangreger.net/2019/02/ux-closed-captions-for-everybody/">Source: close captions for everybody</a></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <blockquote>English isn't my native language. Captions make videos easier to understand, and help me improve my English skills.</blockquote>
    </section>

  <section>
    <blockquote>When characters are mumbling, or speak with an unfamiliar accent.</blockquote>
    </section>
  
    <section>
      <blockquote>Because there are multiple people in the room with me while I'm watching a video, all using different screens (competing noise).</blockquote>
    </section>
    <section>
      <blockquote>I have ADHD. Captions help me focus. </blockquote>
    </section>
  
    <section>
      <blockquote>I'm watching TV with the volume down so my baby won't wake up from the noise.</blockquote>
    </section>
  
    <section>
    <blockquote>Crunchy snacks.</blockquote>
    </section>